      <![CDATA[<p>很多人都会遇到这种想进行截图学习，但无法进行截图的情况</p><p><img src="https://p0-xtjj-private.juejin.cn/tos-cn-i-73owjymdk6/4d62785375004217927839ff5681faf8~tplv-73owjymdk6-jj-mark-v1:0:0:0:0:5o6Y6YeR5oqA5pyv56S-5Yy6IEAgTFpfNjY2:q75.awebp?policy=eyJ2bSI6MywidWlkIjoiMzE3MjU1NzMwOTYwODc2NCJ9&rk3s=f64ab15b&x-orig-authkey=f32326d3454f2ac7e96d3d06cdbb035152127018&x-orig-expires=1793874805&x-orig-sign=5zCfij1pfV2t8pU2mB2zkajU/i4=" alt="image.png"></p><p>推荐一个强制截图的模块（需要root）</p><p>第一步安装lsposed，启用截图模块，shizuku</p><p>第二步在root软件中安装lsposed</p><p>第三步在连接shizuku，在lsposed上安装模块</p><p>第四步重启，在通知栏，看到lsp页面通知则为成功，然后就可以正常使用了</p><p><img src="https://p0-xtjj-private.juejin.cn/tos-cn-i-73owjymdk6/9e403bb1fd3445b684b4b8d664d0620b~tplv-73owjymdk6-jj-mark-v1:0:0:0:0:5o6Y6YeR5oqA5pyv56S-5Yy6IEAgTFpfNjY2:q75.awebp?policy=eyJ2bSI6MywidWlkIjoiMzE3MjU1NzMwOTYwODc2NCJ9&rk3s=f64ab15b&x-orig-authkey=f32326d3454f2ac7e96d3d06cdbb035152127018&x-orig-expires=1793874805&x-orig-sign=cgBu5aXEQrbi5oZ0G5eNfPmYY6M=" alt="image.png"></p><p><img src="https://p0-xtjj-private.juejin.cn/tos-cn-i-73owjymdk6/ffc7e5c7faf6410a9494c5da074264a7~tplv-73owjymdk6-jj-mark-v1:0:0:0:0:5o6Y6YeR5oqA5pyv56S-5Yy6IEAgTFpfNjY2:q75.awebp?policy=eyJ2bSI6MywidWlkIjoiMzE3MjU1NzMwOTYwODc2NCJ9&rk3s=f64ab15b&x-orig-authkey=f32326d3454f2ac7e96d3d06cdbb035152127018&x-orig-expires=1793874805&x-orig-sign=30ErTgIlEO/6nhW2HOvC+51jYEo=" alt="image.png"></p><p>lspoed官网<a href="https://lsposed.cn/lsposed">LSPosed-LSPosed中文网</a></p><p>模块下载地址<a href="https://release-assets.githubusercontent.com/github-production-release-asset/335557022/2619460c-8f41-4524-9de2-ecf17431a40e?sp=r&sv=2018-11-09&sr=b&spr=https&se=2026-08-30T09:15:34Z&rscd=attachment;+filename=app-release.apk&rsct=application/vnd.android.package-archive&skoid=96c2d410-5711-43a1-aedd-ab1947aa7ab0&sktid=398a6654-997b-47e9-b12b-9515b896b4de&skt=2026-08-30T08:15:34Z&ske=2026-08-30T09:15:34Z&sks=b&skv=2018-11-09&sig=lxjlGLW3BTNzR1mXaJGwwLQefWoJQCv7LUVvyAq49Kk=&jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJp